  m_Name: Carta_RedeDeFibraOptica
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Rede de Fibra \xD3ptica"
  _titleEn: Fiber Optic Network
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Internet r\xE1pida e est\xE1vel \xE9 a base de servi\xE7os digitais,
    trabalho remoto e sensores na cidade."
  _summaryEn: Fast, reliable internet is the foundation for digital services, remote
    work and sensors in the city.
  _realWorld: "A companhia de energia municipal de Chattanooga, nos Estados Unidos,
    montou uma rede de fibra pr\xF3pria e passou a oferecer internet de 1 gigabit
    em 2010."
  _realWorldEn: Chattanooga's municipal power company, in the United States, built
    its own fiber network and began offering 1-gigabit internet in 2010.
  _tradeOffs: "Instalar fibra custa caro, e bairros pobres costumam ser os \xFAltimos
    a receber."
  _tradeOffsEn: Laying fiber is expensive, and poor neighborhoods are often the last
    to get it.
  _sources:
  - Label: EPB (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EPB
